# Gap spec style

`gap/spec.md` is a formal language spec used to generate an implementation.

- Prefer formulas for syntax, evaluation, binding, and sugar
- Keep `#` comments next to formulas
- Keep English that an implementer needs to write code: AST distinctions,
  dispatch order, when a rule waits, error vs residual, parse vs reduce,
  desugaring, capture avoidance
- Do not add philosophy, goals, rationale, tutorials, or checklists
- Do not delete implementer English or `#` comments to make a block denser
